{"3767720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "The Tower of Shadows", "steam_appid": 3767720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Short Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Tower of Shadows</i> is a tactical turn-based game where each floor of a mysterious tower is a unique challenge. In a dark, atmospheric world, the player climbs floor after floor to confront the Master of Shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different: enemy compositions, rewards, rooms, and events are procedurally generated, offering strong replayability. The game demands strategy, adaptation, and perseverance — players will fail, retry, and grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classics like <i>Heroes of Might and Magic</i>, <i>The Tower of Shadows</i> blends exploration, tactical combat, and progression with a competitive scoring system for players seeking mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗡 Tactical Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic, top‑down battles requiring planning and adaptation</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dozens of spells, units, and synergies to master</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🏰 A Tower Full of Trials</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4 full biomes + final boss floor</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Around <strong>1h30 per biome</strong>, offering a substantial adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural generation ensures every run feels fresh</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>📚 Deep Progression</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>90+ spells</strong> in the Hero Spellbook</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>35+ hero equipment items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>50+ unique items</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>14 recruitable units</strong> + <strong>2 champions</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>25 enemies</strong> + <strong>4 bosses</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >NPC vendor, loot variety, evolving bestiary</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🔁 High Replayability</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Procedural rooms, enemies, and rewards</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scoring system for competitive players</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A challenging experience designed to be replayed many times</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🌍 Full Localization</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Text: FR / EN / DE / RU</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Audio: FR &amp; EN</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cinematics included</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🎮 Short Description</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>The Tower of Shadows</i> is a tactical turn-based game where each floor of a mysterious tower is a unique challenge. In a dark, atmospheric world, the player climbs floor after floor to confront the Master of Shadows.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different: enemy compositions, rewards, rooms, and events are procedurally generated, offering strong replayability. The game demands strategy, adaptation, and perseverance — players will fail, retry, and grow stronger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by classics like <i>Heroes of Might and Magic</i>, <i>The Tower of Shadows</i> blends exploration, tactical combat, and progression with a competitive scoring system for players seeking mastery.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>✨ Key Features</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>🗡 Tactical Turn-Based Combat</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Strategic, top‑down battles requiring planning and adaptation<